     "<div dir=\"ltr\">請教各位前輩，<div>最近想要下載網站上的資料但檔案太多不想一個個下載，因此想寫個程式一次把檔案抓下來，目前還在整理檔案網址名稱的階段就遇到了困難 &gt;&lt;</div><div>嘗試以for迴圈讓網址名稱以小時重複排下去，如 (小時 分 秒) 000000.csv , 000500.csv , 001000.csv..................234500.csv , 235000.csv , 235500.csv，但跑出來只有230000之後的名稱，想詢問一下為什麼? 與如何解決? 煩請各為指教，謝謝!!</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-izZZZpNcECw/WudV_9HQwII/AAAAAAAADcg/wkllRCTqRb4UtAsV0E6B71c0PJdkhk80QCLcBGAs/s1600/problem1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-izZZZpNcECw/WudV_9HQwII/AAAAAAAADcg/wkllRCTqRb4UtAsV0E6B71c0PJdkhk80QCLcBGAs/s1600/problem1.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237467203000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SLbauRGkzfC3fJ7IkFUF9\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-izZZZpNcECw/WudV_9HQwII/AAAAAAAADcg/wkllRCTqRb4UtAsV0E6B71c0PJdkhk80QCLcBGAs/s1600/problem1.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Zy7MI1Uifuc/WudYlGmuk5I/AAAAAAAADcs/0_OBcLq5M7soW9idh2Xn3O074UFdUVRcgCLcBGAs/s1600/problem2.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Zy7MI1Uifuc/WudYlGmuk5I/AAAAAAAADcs/0_OBcLq5M7soW9idh2Xn3O074UFdUVRcgCLcBGAs/s1600/problem2.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237467203000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MgdH-4Gkr4wumWVDCfaVY\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Zy7MI1Uifuc/WudYlGmuk5I/AAAAAAAADcs/0_OBcLq5M7soW9idh2Xn3O074UFdUVRcgCLcBGAs/s1600/problem2.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
